# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) and fill in ONE delivery option
# below. In production use `wrangler secret put <NAME>` - never commit values.

# Option 1 - Resend (https://resend.com).
# Best if you want mail sent from your own domain; requires the FROM_EMAIL
# domain (no-reply@bluebyteitinfosystem.com) to be verified in Resend.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Option 2 - Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com).
# Free, and needs no email infrastructure: sign up with the address that should
# receive the messages and paste the access key here.
# WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Option 3 - any endpoint that accepts a JSON POST (Slack incoming webhook,
# Zapier, your own API). Also the easiest way to test locally:
#   CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9111/hook
# CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=

# Optional. Extra hosts allowed to submit the form, comma separated.
# The site's own host is always allowed automatically.
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=www.bluebyteitsolutions.com
